    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "3. It is alleged that the petitioner was having illicit relationship with the mother of victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 878,
      "end": 974,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27374446392059326
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "4. It appears that this petitioner also started sexually assaulting the victim and thereafter he sold the victim to one Butul Behra @ Butun Behra.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 976,
      "end": 1122,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Butul Behra @ Butun Behra",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1096,
          "end": 1121
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17778508365154266
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "It further appears that bail application of co-accused Butul Behra @ Butun Behra has been twice rejected by this Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1123,
      "end": 1242,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Butul Behra @ Butun Behra",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1178,
          "end": 1203
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14048777520656586
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "5. Learned counsel appearing on behalf of the petitioner submitted that mother of the victim has been granted bail by a co-ordinate Bench of this Court vide B.A. No. 3168/2025.\n6.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1244,
      "end": 1423,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "B.A. No. 3168/2025",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1401,
          "end": 1419
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10732699930667877
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Considering the nature of allegation, I am not inclined to release the petitioner, on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1424,
      "end": 1515,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "Accordingly, his prayer for bail stands rejected.",
